:"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"98936","synopsis":"Raikou and Seimei take an apprentice assigned by the Watchdog Center under their wing. While rumors of a possible Horror that is killing warriors for their swords are circulating within the capital, Seimei decides to look into this new apprentice.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401919/screencap/62298d1688825.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"98937","synopsis":"Someone has placed curses throughout the mansion of Michinaga, Minister of the Left. The police magistrate immediately begins to investigate, taking all onmyouji that are not from the Onmyouryo into custody in order to find the culprit.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401920/screencap/62298d18db86a.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"98938","synopsis":"Everyone in the capital is currently gossiping about the beautiful blue-eyed princess Kaguya. Her beauty is breathtaking and suitors fight desperately for her hand in marriage. Rumors spread that she is cursed as her suitors die one after another.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401921/screencap/62298d1b29266.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"98939","synopsis":"Raikou meets Yasusuke again and befriends him. Yasusuke is part of the police magistrate, but in love with a discharged criminal named Kosode. Each struggle with their status. Is there any way to overcome the gap between the rich and poor?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401922/screencap/62298d1d4fe28.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"98940","synopsis":"Though parents worry over their children, the children themselves rarely realize. Seimei finds an exquisite item after a day of shopping around Touji Temple, only to have it stolen by a little brat! Raikou and Kintoki give chase and meet Gobeh.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401923/screencap/62298d1f26681.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"98941","synopsis":"The seal on Seimei's mother weakens and the Horror within tries to get out. As Douman works to free the Horror buried under Kumano, Michinaga sends Seimei to eliminate the threat. Raikou chases after Seimei to stop her from killing her own mother.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401924/screencap/62298d218fc52.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"98943","synopsis":"The Fujiwara household is the next to be attacked by a Horror. Yorinobu visits Seimei in hopes of aid, but Raikou ends up going with Yorinobu alone. Yorinobu unawaringly leads Raikou back to his birthplace and Tadano Shinbochi's darkness is revealed.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401925/screencap/62298d23ad750.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"98942","synopsis":"Raikou fights a Horror that absorbs light and gets the light of the Golden Armor stolen from him. After eliminating the Horror, Seimei and Kintoki quickly realize that Raikou is still affected by the darkness that seeped into Zaruba and his armor.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401926/screencap/62298d25d20a7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"98944","synopsis":"A Horror appears in the mansion that houses low-ranking onmyouji. Unable to admit the possibility of onmyouji falling victim to a Horror, Yasunori claims it to be the work of aristocrats against Michinaga. Raikou tries to fight it alone, but...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401927/screencap/62298d2809d2e.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"98945","synopsis":"Yasumasa goes in search of the legendary Silver Armor that is said to be passed down the Fujiwara family. At the same time, his little brother, Yasusuke, meets a certain man that will change his life. Whether he wants to change or not.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401928/screencap/62298d2a13e9e.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"98947","synopsis":"The cast members talk about the first half of the new season, gathering around a hotpot for an intimate chat.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401929/screencap/62298d2c244be.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"98946","synopsis":"The Raise Gate's construction is coming to an end, but there are shadows moving about in the darkness. Raikou broods over the words left by the knight Zanga as he urges Seimei to remove the seal she placed on him. Seimei must make a choice.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401930/screencap/62298d2e43bce.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 14","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"98949","synopsis":"Abandoned by Raikou, Seimei moves forward to hunt Ashiya Douman down herself. The darkness grows within her as she heads to the Light Palace. At the same time, Raikou seethes with anger, blaming both himself and Seimei for the deaths of the innocent.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401931/screencap/62298d30771ec.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"98948","synopsis":"Though Raikou has gained the power to don the Golden Armor himself, he is unable to move forward whole heartedly with Seimei missing. The Light Palace is quickly recovering from the Horror attack, but now aristocrat girls have begun disappearing.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401932/screencap/62298d65b3cab.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 16","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"98951","synopsis":"No matter what era, there are always problems between husband and wife. Especially when that husband is a man like Masamune, who is well-known for his cheating ways. Izumi Shikibu tries to help her friend and enlists the help of Raikou and Kintoki.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401933/screencap/62298d34a95da.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 17","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"98950","synopsis":"Two brothers who fight for what they believe is right in two completely different ways decide to team up. Yasusuke finds out that perhaps his older brother, Yasumasa, is not the weak man hungry for social power that he once believed him to be.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401934/screencap/6229b9639e420.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 18","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"98952","synopsis":"Seimei chases after Douma in hopes of finding a way to eliminate the darkness eating away at her. Haruaki finds Seimei and realizes quickly that something must be done. Her time is running out and something inside her wants to take control.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401935/screencap/62298d390eb8b.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 19","episodeNumber":19,"sourceEpisodeNumber":19,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"98953","synopsis":"Seimei's body has been taken over by the darkness and Rudra runs rampant in the city in search of the Golden Knight. Various people close to Raikou get hurt in the process. Will Raikou raise his sword against Seimei once he sees what she has become?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401936/screencap/62298d3b17f04.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":20,"sourceEpisodeNumber":20,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"98954","synopsis":"Raikou realizes that Seimei is the vessel that the Watchdog Center ordered him to destroy. And though Kaguya is the key to the seal of the Crimson Moon, she is currently powerless. Torn between his duty and his emotions, Raikou slowly loses hope.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401937/screencap/62298d3d8bb1c.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 21","episodeNumber":21,"sourceEpisodeNumber":21,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"98955","synopsis":"Inari gives Hakamadare a glowing ball which has a Madou fire sealed within it. Meanwhile, Raikou receives news that Seimei killed Yasumasa and he tries to stop Hakamadare from attacking Seimei.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401938/screencap/62298d3fd1d7f.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 22","episodeNumber":22,"sourceEpisodeNumber":22,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11459","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21277","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"mal","id":"28537","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"64139","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303145","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"98957","synopsis":"Hakamadare tries to kill Seimei, but Raikou stops him, so he withdraws, but asserts that Raikou must take responsibility for the consequences. Haruaki prepares a trap so that when Seimei chases Raikou, Kaguya binds Seimei so that Raikou can reach her heart. Raikou finds himself in a wilderness and reaches Seimei, but he is attacked by the female form of Rudra. Outside, Douman arrives to stop the process, but is attacked by Kintoki who distracts him long enough for Raikou and Seimei to exorcise Rudra from within Seimei. Inari then appears and deals with Douman. Later, Haruaki succumbs and collapses to the effort he expended in rescuing Seimei and sealing Rudra within himself. Seimei then has to ask Raikou to destroy her grandfather Haruaki, to finally defeat Rudra. Meanwhile, Douman is still alive.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5401939/screencap/62298d4221e92.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 23","episodeNumber":23,"sourceEpisodeNumber":23,"seasonNumber":1,"exter